WEBVTT

01:06.840 --> 01:07.680
Mingyue.

01:26.039 --> 01:28.100
She was also poisoned by Wushanxing.

01:55.880 --> 01:56.840
Your Highness,

01:57.400 --> 01:59.060
His Majesty is expecting you.

02:29.760 --> 02:30.640
Ji Mingyue.

02:31.520 --> 02:33.050
You better not regret this.

03:26.240 --> 03:27.040
Your Majesty.

03:33.920 --> 03:35.120
Father, you summoned me.

03:35.120 --> 03:36.480
Do you have any orders?

03:36.920 --> 03:38.880
I am old.

03:38.880 --> 03:40.280
This world

03:41.400 --> 03:43.600
will be yours sooner or later.

03:44.120 --> 03:45.760
Why are you in such a hurry?

03:49.240 --> 03:50.360
Yes.

03:55.079 --> 03:56.920
What are you talking about, Father?

03:56.920 --> 03:58.120
I don't understand.

03:58.480 --> 04:02.360
You have been insatiable since childhood.

04:02.800 --> 04:04.440
You are ruthless,

04:04.440 --> 04:05.840
but lack wisdom.

04:07.120 --> 04:08.120
I know.

04:10.560 --> 04:12.440
You like Ji Mingyue.

04:13.000 --> 04:14.440
But to assassinate me

04:14.440 --> 04:15.880
for her...

04:16.440 --> 04:17.000
You...

04:18.680 --> 04:20.560
You have lost your mind.

04:21.120 --> 04:23.320
Father.

04:23.480 --> 04:24.280
Father.

04:25.200 --> 04:26.160
Father,

04:26.160 --> 04:26.720
please,

04:26.720 --> 04:27.720
forgive me.

04:27.800 --> 04:28.800
I know I was wrong.

04:28.960 --> 04:30.490
Please forgive me, Father.

04:31.840 --> 04:33.120
It really was you.

04:34.000 --> 04:36.320
You rebelled for a woman.

04:38.640 --> 04:40.700
You killed your father and your king.

04:41.400 --> 04:43.240
Shen Mingyue must die.

04:43.560 --> 04:44.400
Guards!

04:44.400 --> 04:45.240
Guards!

04:47.120 --> 04:49.080
Father.

04:49.480 --> 04:51.040
As long as you are dead,

04:52.360 --> 04:53.960
the world is mine.

04:55.320 --> 04:57.520
How could I rebel?

05:01.480 --> 05:02.880
I just want to tell you

05:04.080 --> 05:05.840
that Ji Mingyue must be mine.

05:06.440 --> 05:07.680
Must be mine.

05:32.840 --> 05:33.480
Mother.

05:33.560 --> 05:34.720
No.

05:35.560 --> 05:36.960
They said Huo Lingyu from the Hanlin Academy

05:36.960 --> 05:39.520
was summoned to the palace at the hour of Xu,

05:39.520 --> 05:41.280
and hasn't left yet.

05:42.360 --> 05:42.520
Lingyu.

05:42.520 --> 05:43.360
Huo Lingyu.

05:53.320 --> 05:55.650
The Wushanxing poison was cured with her.

05:56.080 --> 05:57.480
But the Qianji poison...

06:10.240 --> 06:11.040
Jiuying.

06:11.480 --> 06:13.280
The one-month deadline has arrived.

06:13.280 --> 06:15.140
You still haven't got the ledger.

06:15.560 --> 06:16.760
This time, the antidote

06:16.760 --> 06:18.200
is only half a pill.

06:27.480 --> 06:29.280
The antidote comes once a month.

06:29.360 --> 06:31.600
I can neither recover nor die.

06:32.640 --> 06:36.300
I wonder how much longer I'll be controlled by this Qianji poison.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.360
I am incompetent.

06:44.520 --> 06:47.280
I didn't realize there was a problem with the incense burner.

06:47.280 --> 06:48.140
Your Highness.

06:48.680 --> 06:51.940
Perhaps we should have the imperial physician take a look.

06:58.200 --> 06:59.400
You ran fast.

06:59.880 --> 07:02.280
You'd better not let me find out who you are.

07:02.400 --> 07:03.530
Where is Huo Lingyu?

07:04.240 --> 07:06.520
I couldn't find you last night.

07:06.520 --> 07:08.520
So I escorted Lord Huo out of the palace first.

07:08.520 --> 07:12.120
Right now, he is in the side hall study teaching the Ninth Prince.

07:25.080 --> 07:26.320
Tracing

07:26.320 --> 07:28.050
doesn't mean copying rigidly.

07:29.080 --> 07:30.160
Relax your wrist.

07:30.880 --> 07:31.960
Write decisively.

07:32.840 --> 07:34.100
Control your strokes.

07:35.040 --> 07:36.960
And follow your heart.

07:48.480 --> 07:49.600
It's a promise.

07:49.600 --> 07:50.680
Today at dusk,

07:50.760 --> 07:52.440
when the moon rises above the willows,

07:52.440 --> 07:54.040
wait for me at Wangyue Bridge.

07:54.040 --> 07:56.500
I have something very important to tell you.

07:56.680 --> 07:58.840
Miss Shen, this meeting is inappropriate.

07:58.840 --> 07:59.920
Today is Qixi.

07:59.920 --> 08:00.960
Meeting today

08:00.960 --> 08:02.240
might harm your reputation, Miss Shen.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.240
Cut the nonsense.

08:03.440 --> 08:04.840
If I tell you to go, you go.

08:05.240 --> 08:06.600
If you dare not to show up,

08:06.600 --> 08:08.560
I'll go to the Huo Residence to find you myself.

08:08.560 --> 08:09.240
You

08:12.360 --> 08:13.240
know me.

08:13.480 --> 08:14.680
I always keep my word.

08:20.640 --> 08:21.480
Alright.

08:40.280 --> 08:43.400
By the grace of Heaven, the Emperor decrees:

08:43.400 --> 08:44.680
Shen Mingyue

08:44.680 --> 08:46.040
is pure and noble,

08:46.040 --> 08:47.400
gentle and virtuous.

08:47.400 --> 08:48.920
She has my heart.

08:48.920 --> 08:50.760
The position of Empress is vacant,

08:50.760 --> 08:52.720
and I wish to make her my Empress.

08:52.720 --> 08:55.120
He is as bright as the moon among the clouds.

08:55.560 --> 08:56.560
But I...

08:57.680 --> 08:58.680
It's fine.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.440
Let it be.

09:35.600 --> 09:39.260
I pay my respects to Her Majesty the Empress. My respects, Mother.

09:40.560 --> 09:43.520
The Huo family is involved in the gold embezzlement case.

09:43.520 --> 09:44.850
Should I tell him first?

09:45.400 --> 09:46.200
Huo Lingyu.

09:46.600 --> 09:48.480
Where were you last night?

09:49.160 --> 09:50.560
Her Majesty summoned me,

09:50.560 --> 09:52.620
so naturally, I was in Fengyi Palace.

09:54.480 --> 09:55.280
Huo Lingyu.

09:59.360 --> 10:00.000
Arrest him.

10:00.000 --> 10:00.560
Yes.

10:04.680 --> 10:07.840
The Huo clan colluded with the frontier official Baili Jinghong.

10:07.840 --> 10:08.960
They secretly cooked the books,

10:08.960 --> 10:09.960
and embezzled gold.

10:09.960 --> 10:11.280
The entire clan will be punished.

10:11.280 --> 10:12.000
Shackle him.

10:12.000 --> 10:12.680
Wait.

10:13.480 --> 10:14.880
I am an imperial scholar.

10:15.160 --> 10:16.680
Before the three judicial departments convict him,

10:16.680 --> 10:18.410
he doesn't have to be shackled.

10:19.120 --> 10:19.920
Mother.

10:20.400 --> 10:21.730
He is your man after all.

10:22.400 --> 10:23.840
Aren't you going to plead for him

10:23.840 --> 10:24.900
or worry about him?

10:26.400 --> 10:27.730
Why should I be worried?

10:28.680 --> 10:30.320
Then in your opinion, Mother,

10:30.320 --> 10:31.480
how should the Huo clan

10:31.480 --> 10:32.800
be dealt with?

10:33.480 --> 10:34.810
If the charges are true,

10:36.120 --> 10:38.720
Naturally, the whole family will be executed.

10:49.240 --> 10:50.040
Oh.

10:50.360 --> 10:51.960
Isn't this Ninth Brother?

10:51.960 --> 10:53.960
You didn't even say a word when you saw me.

10:53.960 --> 10:55.490
Greetings, Your Highness.

11:00.080 --> 11:01.400
Ninth Brother.

11:01.400 --> 11:04.800
Your teacher broke the law and corrupted the imperial court.

11:06.040 --> 11:07.800
Don't follow his example.

11:08.160 --> 11:09.120
I wouldn't dare.

11:21.720 --> 11:22.400
Strange.

11:22.880 --> 11:24.480
That dog emperor isn't dead yet.

11:24.480 --> 11:26.280
How dare he touch the Huo family?

11:29.880 --> 11:32.080
This is the sound of national mourning.

11:32.160 --> 11:33.490
Father has passed away.

11:43.280 --> 11:47.040
Your Majesty the Empress, please receive the edict.

11:53.480 --> 11:55.120
By the grace of Heaven,

11:55.280 --> 11:56.800
the Emperor decrees:

11:57.280 --> 12:00.560
I have been the emperor for over twenty years.

12:00.560 --> 12:02.600
Grateful for Empress Ji's

12:02.600 --> 12:05.200
deep love, though we cannot grow old together,

12:05.200 --> 12:06.560
I cannot bear to leave her behind.

12:06.560 --> 12:07.800
After I pass away,

12:07.800 --> 12:10.720
I grant the Empress to be buried with me in the same tomb.

12:10.720 --> 12:12.000
Respect this.

12:13.920 --> 12:15.760
Please receive the edict.

12:24.680 --> 12:26.740
Commit suicide to be buried with him?

12:27.320 --> 12:28.380
Does he deserve it?

12:28.920 --> 12:31.560
My Shen family has slaved for the Ji clan for three generations.

12:31.560 --> 12:33.640
Any favors we owed have long been repaid.

12:33.640 --> 12:36.520
He is delusional to think I would be buried with him.

12:37.280 --> 12:40.340
He claimed I love eating exotic fish from the South Sea,

12:40.440 --> 12:42.900
exhausting 300 horses to death every month.

12:43.120 --> 12:45.600
In fact, he just heard this fish could prolong life

12:45.600 --> 12:47.200
and wanted to eat it himself.

12:47.720 --> 12:48.960
To seek immortality,

12:49.080 --> 12:50.840
he extracted hearts to make medicine.

12:50.840 --> 12:53.880
He used the excuse that I wanted to refine an elixir of youth.

12:53.880 --> 12:55.640
He slung mud at me while alive,

12:56.000 --> 12:57.800
and won't let me go even in death.

12:59.600 --> 13:02.200
Your Highness, please make preparations for the aftermath early.

13:02.200 --> 13:04.660
Follow the decree and join the late emperor.

13:05.280 --> 13:07.340
What if I refuse to accept the decree?

13:07.640 --> 13:10.360
I know Your Highness has great power.

13:11.160 --> 13:12.960
If you disobey the emperor's will

13:12.960 --> 13:14.440
and openly resist the decree,

13:14.440 --> 13:18.880
no one in the Shen family will be spared.
